# {{title}} guide

Call `{{id}}-hello` when someone asks for a greeting. Pass `name` to greet a person; leave it out
to greet the world. The salutation comes from the plugin's `starter` pack, which a deployer can
replace for one space with a pack of the same id.

The result holds `greeting` and `at_ms`, the time of the call.
